    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Everyone is looking at the wrong thing. On purpose.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Perfect Misdirection (1/Soma Break).</strong> For 1 minute, hostile creatures roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on attacks against you unless they succeed a Soul defense check at the start of their turn (DC = 8 + tier + Intrigue). Also, once per minute you may force a ranged attack to miss by “editing the frame.”</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"circParMisdirection\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Perfect Misdirection</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">For 1 minute, hostiles roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on attacks vs. you unless they pass a Soul check (DC 8 + tier + Intrigue). Once per minute, force a ranged attack to miss.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
